{"server":"tw","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_01_end","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_01","title":"塞上春來","storyCode":"WB-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"85c986132b34af484f055f42a0133244dd4963dbff8fe0c1ce72899cd8351fc8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可知你現在身在何處，手裡拿著的那把劍又是何物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一把劍，我要找的劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先不問你是受何人指使，又為何能出現在此處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把劍交出來，跟我去見宗師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薄情寡義，背信棄義之人，不配擁有這把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放肆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師守護玉門安危百年，豈容你信口玷污？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裝模作樣，你又知道些什麼？讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逮捕過的不法之徒不少，像閣下這樣囂張的，我還是頭一回見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"表面道貌岸然，其實自私自利。你們這樣的人，我見多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我只好用強硬手段請閣下伏法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你出刀，試試看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝負已分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的勝負，不是在這裡分出的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人和說法，閣下總得留下一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要一些答案。但你給不了我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是讓她逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"受了那麼重的傷，總該跑不遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"魏老二，你這把老骨頭也是不管用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"有勞林先生搭救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"堂堂赤霄劍主人，被仇家找上門來，也要靠他人搭救了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我可真不記得，我還有這麼一號仇家——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聲東擊西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷了。還能往哪裡逃？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，這裡又發生了什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我疏忽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍，被盜走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稟將軍，內城樓方圓五里內沒有找到刺客下落，也沒有發現有其他賊寇接應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有其他人受到襲擊，核心內城、軍武庫也沒有被闖入的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是沒有“痕跡”，還是確認沒有被闖入？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時，無法確認......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這世上竟還有人能隨意出入玉門軍營，連你們四位高手都留不下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是咄咄怪事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪我大意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公對於刺客身份，可有些眉目？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年來，想要這條命的人，很多，但魏彥吾還好好地活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要嘛放下了念頭，要嘛已經變成了一抔黃土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚這位朋友，我的確不認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左樂，你那邊有什麼發現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事發突然，我準備不及，沒能捉拿刺客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有問你為何沒能捉住刺客，我問你看到了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潛入盜劍的刺客，是個年輕女性，逃走時身上負了傷。除此之外......沒有更多的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒杯碎裂，殘片盡數被平祟侯攥在手心。\n貴賓在座，但他那一瞬還是沒能收住怒意，就像日間沒能控制住自己引弓時顫抖的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，多說無益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳我命令。立即封鎖城門，各城區之間加設哨所，禁止一切不必要的人員流動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，通報全城，玉門城兩日後申時起，減速以調整航線，請百姓有所準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓捕刺客，追回宗師佩劍，找出潛藏在城內的山海眾，三件事全須做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你三日時間，我的親兵交由你調遣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得走漏消息，不得驚擾百姓安生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"守軍就位後他就已經離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"林畢竟不算朝堂中人，就不便領平祟侯將令了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不知還有什麼事是我能幫上忙的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜刺客顯然是衝魏公而來，魏公還是應當以自身安全為重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到事情平息，我再另外派遣軍隊護送魏公返回龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天，魏公還是不要四處走動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道這“不要走動”的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是不要走動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的事情，玉門自己解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次敵人來頭不小，不如還是由我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是有勞宗師留在軍營，保護太傅和魏公安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是放任賊寇在城中流竄，同樣危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事是由巨獸而起，以宗師身份，不方便出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟應該知道宗師真正身份的人，也就只有這間屋子裡的各位了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"將軍的話音不重，卻讓整間屋子安靜了下來。\n不知哪個角落傳來一聲歎氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......也罷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"末將這樣安排，太傅可有異議？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信平祟侯的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以上安排，即刻執行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，您沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打死我也不相信，這世上還有能傷到他的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是信任我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，你們都已經聽說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城外領兵暫且不論。城內的治安佈防，本來就是你的職責範圍。左宣遼這樣安排，擺明了不信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左將軍的意思，我當然明白，也能體諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以這幾天，有些事還得拜託你替我走動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次事態非常，敵人也格外棘手，左樂那邊，你最好能多幫幫他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按他的個性，也未必就願意讓我插手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們之間的事，也不適宜在這時候解決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用多說，我心裡有數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天無事可做，那《武典》最後的幾章，辛苦你陪我儘快撰寫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是學生應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師沒有別的吩咐，學生就告辭了。老師也早些休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"也不知道是看見了牆壁上空著的劍架，還是別的什麼，男人一聲歎息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這局棋，你到底還要捲入多少人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一瓢清水倒入濁江，便再也不能從江中舀出一瓢同樣的清水。這樣的道理你難道不明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你取而代之，也絕無可能在一片混沌中再見她一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做這一切，又是何苦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處巡邏隊伍行進時的甲胄碰撞聲依稀可聞，除此外便再無別的聲響。\n夜色蒼茫，這個喧囂的夜晚終於安靜了下來。\n又是一聲長長的歎息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你很有勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我居然沒有發現，你也在這裡......"},{"type":"narration","text":"我當然也在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道要阻止我？"},{"type":"narration","text":"善弈者通局無妙手，你的行為，未免太激進了點。\n哦......或許是因為，你已時日無多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說時日無多，你應該也沒有什麼餘裕。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你當真以為，那人將“自己”封印入劍，就可以等閒視之？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是為了“一”而來，豈會擔心那十二分之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我反而想問，你又憑什麼覺得，你可以成為他？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不會成為他。我始終是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與他的事，需要做一個了結。"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是你們的恩怨。\n我們並非敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不完全由你說了算。"},{"type":"narration","text":"至少當下，我們各自應該都有更重要的事要做。\n我們不會是彼此的妨礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在向我求和？"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩分之勢，你沒有理由拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你果然和你的“兄弟姐妹”很不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望下次再見的時候，你能讓我看到一些有趣的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐！聽說您今天——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別聲張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說過了不要這麼光明正大地見我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"您沒事就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們那邊有什麼進展沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門集市幾年一開，貨流量和人流量都很大，人多眼雜，暫時還沒有頭緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不好查，就請人幫我們查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門集市的這些商販，有多少是本地人，又有多少是從龍門過來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後面這批人裡，有多少在近衛局那邊手續並不齊全，是受了我們照顧的？篩一遍，找個比我們方便行事的，不難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐，這......似乎不太合規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按我說的做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"narration","text":"半月前"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨獸信徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"情報的來源，你沒必要細問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"炎國千百年來對付過的敵人，從來不只在明處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然玉門常年依靠龍門補給，但城中治安應該不是您職責之內的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門是一面堅不可破的盾，但是盾牌背面潛藏的蛀蟲，需要另外有人來幫它驅除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我想派你去解決這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以讓你以龍門近衛局特別指揮使的身份行動，名義上的工作是負責兩城對接期間的治安問題。我也會給你一定的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"徹查潛藏在玉門民間的危險份子，確保玉門平安歸航。如有必要，也可以採用極端手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼是我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你是林雨霞，你可以做到這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"當年鼠王在龍門做過的事，我需要你在玉門再做一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏長官......您在找到我之前，並沒有和我爸談過，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸？您沒說過會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你領了魏彥吾的任務，我總得跟過來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您都知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"“搜查走私犯”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想讓您為難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"還要你費盡心思地瞞著我，為難的應該是魏彥吾才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你就沒有想過拒絕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除暴安良，安撫百姓的事，總得有人來做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾手下能辦這件事的人物有的是，他就一定要你來蹚這渾水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我就是用尾巴尖都能想到，魏老二用的是哪一套說辭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚發生的事，也得讓你知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才守軍封鎖了城門，原來就是為了這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從白天到晚上，這連續發生的事情，如果說是巧合，那未免也太巧合了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門總督遇刺，宗師佩劍被盜，欽天監信使被殺，無論哪件，單拎出來都是驚天動地的大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"現在居然同時發生，背後牽動的勢力，難以想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾找到你的時候，有沒有跟你講過這件事有多危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只知道這件事非同小可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門不是龍門，你也不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心裡有數......我會謹慎處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次從龍門帶過來的暗樁，都是跟著您有些年頭的好手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"江湖上的事，我也有經驗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是有主意，那就不用我嘮叨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但願這次能早些了事，不耽誤你去維多利亞的行程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一次遊學罷了，不去也沒什麼的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年你幫我，幫近衛局料理了不少事，都沒能去做些自己真正想做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是我自己選的，我做的事也都是為了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"沒見過另一條路，就不能算自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"有時想想，像陳那樣，又何嘗不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸！你受傷了？！我去找醫生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好久沒有活動過手腳，筋骨緊了。看來每天只是在公園散步，運動量還是不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我送你回將軍府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"也不用，我今晚就在這邊客棧歇息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"老朋友打過一次招呼也就夠了。左軍侯府上今晚的氛圍，我可受不了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這可真是巧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚上聽到城邊有動靜，正想是出了什麼大事，現在見到林先生才能確信，出的事肯定小不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生的意思是，我這隻老鼠跟瘟神沒有區別了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豈敢豈敢，玩笑玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞，我和鯉先生說幾句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先告辭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子，你在玉門找人，也不太順利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別提了。一個消失了十幾年的人，我也沒指望能在一個月裡找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不管花多少時間，總還是要找的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生向來是位自在人，只有在這位老朋友的事上，才會這麼操勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是我上輩子欠他的吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你不急在這一時，那我能不能委託鯉氏偵探事務所幫個忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生開了口，我哪有拒絕的道理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過話說回來，最近我接的麻煩事是不是太多了點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"能者多勞，這件事算我姓林的欠你一筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生這麼客氣，我還真得掂量掂量這件事辦不辦得成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這件事，就得你這個人精來做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二......九、十......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"排行榜上前面這些人，各個都不是好對付的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平常心，平常心。盡力而為......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不能出城？我兩個兄弟就這麼死在城外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城門已封閉，姑娘請回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們還講不講道理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，使金瓜的豐蹄漢子直接被踹飛出擂台了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算下來，那個菲林女孩已經連贏了五場！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你好，認識一下，今天你的比賽我全都看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼厲害的功夫，要不要考慮加入我的鏢局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏢局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別拒絕這麼快啊，憑你的身手，我可以給你開一份說得過去的薪資！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有打算靠拳腳吃飯，我可是正經機械工程專業的大學畢業生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"機械什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了！反正你是說自己是理科生對吧？理科生好啊，我說的鏢局，是新型物流公司，理科生正好大有作為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎你別走啊，我說真的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來還發生了這樣的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幾位朋友的遺物和訃告，也只能等到戒嚴結束後才能送回尚蜀了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我帶他們出來的，不管用什麼方式，我都會帶他們回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來玉門之前，我在尚蜀碰巧見過鄭前輩一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鄭前輩告訴過我，等到人人都不需要習武來保護自己的那一天，才算是真正的太平日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹說的這些道理都對，但現在，我更喜歡另外一句江湖老話，血債血償。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定會把兇手找出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼在這？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是白天那個官差大小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說會查清楚嗎？戒了嚴還怎麼查清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也見過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了新的變故，事情比想像的還要棘手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓我和你一起去查！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，也可以幫忙的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事的危險程度，不應該讓旁人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是，什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是外城軍防區傳來的鼓聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，城頭點起烽火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門的傳統，望烽節，這是每年開春的時候，都要舉行的儀式，連續三天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍營的鼓，是敲給城內的將士百姓聽的，征鼓聲聲，告訴人們城池無恙，山河無恙，大炎無恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城頭的烽燧，則是為犧牲在沙場的英靈指一條回家的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回家......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"天災過境、外虜叩邊、流寇滋事......\n整整十七聲軍鼓，象徵著過去一年裡玉門經歷過的大小劫難。\n這座曾橫於北方數百年的塞上城市，因劫難而厚重。這座城市裡的人，因銘記劫難而骨氣錚錚。\n長風不滅原上火，一夜征人盡望鄉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]}]}
